                                      "text": [
                                        "A Door Beside a\nDoor",
                                        "The bypass has a\nplain handle and a\nclear label. Its\ndesigner wrote",
                                        "that the best\nbackup is one a\ntired person can\nfind. No hidden",
                                        "panel, special key\nriddle, or proud\nmaker mark blocks\naccess. The",
