                                    "id": "9960b194-4ef1-4e68-a24a-385ce41e1109",
                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Slush checks the\npublic\nprotections, then\nsigns as one\nparticipant.",
                                        "He has kept the\nold fault card.\nThis time, he\nsays, if my branch",
                                        "fails, I know who\nto call. Pip\nanswers: And they\nknow you will",
                                        "answer back."
                                      ],
