                                          "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "Slush offers his\nroof crew for the\nfirst drafty\nhomes. The clinic",
                                              "gets a plain cost\nestimate before\nanyone orders a\ngold plaque."
