                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The final\nrehearsal combines\ntwo problems: the\nlodge branch is",
                                        "isolated for\nrepair, and the\nrelay reply is\nunconfirmed. Other",
                                        "branches remain\nwithin the service\nbudget. The\narchive foot route\nis",
                                        "available for the\nmessage copy.\nSlush asks if the\nwhole launch must",
                                        "stop. Dot says the\nplan has separate\nresponses for\nseparate faults;",
                                        "the important\nquestion is\nwhether each is\nactually used, not\nwhether",
                                        "the city can\npretend the faults\nnever happened."
                                      ],
